# Lotusguard Disciple: "When this creature enters, target creature or Vehicle gains lifelink and indestructible until end
# of turn." (CR 603.6a, 611.2a, 702.15, 702.12b) On turn 1 Bot1 sets up Moxes, a Mountain and a Memnite; on turn 3 it casts
# the Disciple (a 2/2 flier) and targets the Memnite. A Bolt on the Memnite then deals lethal damage but indestructible
# keeps it alive (CR 702.12b, 704.5g), and attacking with it gains Bot1 1 life from lifelink (CR 702.15b); Bot2 ends at 19.

